eful forecast details.","w":1280},{"h":800,"src":"https:\u002F\u002Faddons.mozilla.org\u002Fuser-media\u002Fpreviews\u002Ffull\u002F410\u002F410911.png?modified=1789866049","thumbnail_h":333,"thumbnail_src":"https:\u002F\u002Faddons.mozilla.org\u002Fuser-media\u002Fpreviews\u002Fthumbs\u002F410\u002F410911.jpg?modified=1789866049","thumbnail_w":533,"title":"Adjust forecast font size, transparency and appearance.","w":1280},{"h":800,"src":"https:\u002F\u002Faddons.mozilla.org\u002Fuser-media\u002Fpreviews\u002Ffull\u002F410\u002F410912.png?modified=1789866052","thumbnail_h":333,"thumbnail_src":"https:\u002F\u002Faddons.mozilla.org\u002Fuser-media\u002Fpreviews\u002Fthumbs\u002F410\u002F410912.jpg?modified=1789866052","thumbnail_w":533,"title":"Meet WeatherExt for iPhone.","w":1280}],"promoted":[{"category":"recommended","apps":["firefox"]}],"ratings":{"average":4.4177,"bayesian_average":4.412426360139348,"count":1185,"text_count":710},"requires_payment":false,"review_url":"https:\u002F\u002Faddons.mozilla.org\u002Fen-US\u002Freviewers\u002Freview\u002F724781","slug":"weather-extension","status":"public","summary":"Weather at a glance in Firefox: toolbar temperature, hourly and daily forecasts, radar, eight themes, and optional Weather Pro features.","support_email":"weatherextension@gmail.com","support_url":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fweatherextension.com\u002Fhelp","outgoing":"https:\u002F\u002Fprod.outgoing.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net\u002Fv1\u002F2d48e8f21213631c82502ade447727278e179c1235c410983784d82da9e45ed8\u002Fhttps%3A\u002F\u002Fweatherextension.com\u002Fhelp"},"tags":[],"type":"extension","url":"https:\u002F\u002Faddons.mozilla.org\u002Fen-US\u002Ffirefox\u002Faddon\u002Fweather-extension\u002F","weekly_downloads":6845,"currentVersionId":6507922,"isMozillaSignedExtension":false,"isAndroidCompatible":false},{"authors":[{"id":18207099,"name":"Pedro","url":"https:\u002F\u002Faddons.mozilla.org\u002Fen-US\u002Ffirefox\u002Fuser\u002F18207099\u002F","username":"anonymous-2ae9f53554a75364173c6ba30318b347"}],"average_daily_users":16437,"categories":["appearance","photos-music-videos","games-entertainment"],"contributions_url":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fko-fi.com\u002Fpedrosou?utm_content=product-page-contribute&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=addons.mozilla.org","outgoing":"https:\u002F\u002Fprod.outgoing.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net\u002Fv1\u002F8ffd565e15b3f1bafb0feb2f6c123c88f6751cf174fd7f7e913b13dcc041c522\u002Fhttps%3A\u002F\u002Fko-fi.com\u002Fpedrosou%3Futm_content=product-page-contribute&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=addons.mozilla.org"},"created":"2023-12-25T00:36:06Z","default_locale":"en-US","description":"Also available for \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fprod.outgoing.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net\u002Fv1\u002Ff87506598241b77446a0f0adf686ad79a57d9ca589efa7f1cd016fada19a485b\u002Fhttps%3A\u002F\u002Fchromewebstore.google.com\u002Fdetail\u002Fyt-tweaks\u002Foeakphpfoaeggagmgphfejmfjbhjfhhh\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003EChrome, Brave, Opera\u003C\u002Fa\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fprod.outgoing.prod.webservices.mozgcp.net\u002Fv1\u002F769d7171c478b7890138375b35e1b5c3df1eb25628266918e3b27bc99b98661c\u002Fhttps%3A\u002F\u002Fmicrosoftedge.microsoft.com\u002Faddons\u002Fdetail\u002Fccckogghpbgibdllcncmehbgeecljpmh\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003EMicrosoft Edge\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\n\n\u003Cstrong\u003EFeatures\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\n• Change the number of videos per row \u002F Change the size of thumbnails\n• Video grid: Hide profile pictures\u002FDecrease font size\n• Show full video titles\n• Show full channel name and upload time\n• Hide Shorts, Mixes, watched videos, upcoming videos and live streams\n• Hide irrelevant search results (For you, People also watched, Previously watched etc.)\n• Search results in Grid view\n• More animations\n• Compact left sidebar\u002Fheader bar\n• Channel page: Default to Videos tab\n• Open search results in new tab\n• YouTube logo: Redirect to Subscriptions\n• Homepage: Hide topic bar and Latest YouTube posts\n• Auto-expand comments\n• Disable auto-opening of live chat\n• Use 'Live chat' by default instead of 'Top chat' in live stream\u002Freplay\n• Show comments in sidebar\n• Comments sorted by newest by default\n• Like\u002Fdislike hotkeys\n• Auto-expand video description\n• Default video quality \u002F Auto HD\u002F4k\u002F8k\n• Default video speed\n• Custom speeds for each channel \u002F Per-channel video speed\n• Quickly adjust playback speed and volume with the mouse wheel\n• Seek the video with the mouse wheel\n• Video focus\n• Volume boost\n• Mono audio\n• Force original audio track\n• Video screenshot\n• Zoom\u002Fflip\u002Fmirror\u002Frotate video\n• Pause the previous video when another starts playing\n• Disable 'Video paused. Continue watching?'\n• Disable auto-play next video in playlists\n• Disable number keys shortcuts\n• Auto-scroll Shorts\n• Disable\u002Fstop Shorts looping\n• Pin video while scrolling\n• Toggle PiP hotkey\n• Show video remaining time\n• Hide video controls on pause\n• Always show progress bar\n• Fullscreen Theater mode\n• Nyan cat progress bar\n• Bring the red subscribe button back\n• Watch page: Allow opening channels from the sidebar\n• Watch page: Hide end cards and buttons Share, Download, Clip, Thanks and Save\n• Left sidebar: Hide Shorts button, Explore and More from YouTube\n• Navigation hotkeys (Home, Subscriptions, Shorts)\n• Video playback hotkeys (Seek, undo seek, change volume, speed and quality, toggle loop)\n• Scroll to top hotkey\n• Show back to top button\n• Over 100 YouTube themes\n• Custom CSS\u002FJavaScript\n\nYouTube is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of this trademark is subject to Google Permissions.","developer_comments":null,"edit_url":"https:\u002F\u002Faddons.mozilla.org\u002Fen-US\u002Fdevelopers\u002Faddon\u002Fyoutube-tweaks\u002Fedit","guid":"{d867162c-4c38-4c5f-aca4-db6a6592d7da}","has_eula":false,"has_privacy_policy":false,"homepage":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fpedro